Library loan in Rust
Console app modeling a Library loan system using Rust structs, assassociated constructors, and methods with immutable and mutable self references.

through this assignment, I learned how to encapsulate state in a custom type, define in-place mutation methods on structs, and enforce boundary constraints to ensure loan days never drop below zero.

* AI Usage 
 Gemini helped me understand (`u32`) from underflow when decrementing days.